                    "sense_id": "a7da9050-3401-3afa-a52f-a2343e6e64ec",
                    "sense_definition": "The edible, high-protein seeds of the quinoa plant, often cooked and eaten like a grain.",
                    "learner_level": "B1",
                    "frequency": "Middle",
                    "semantic_group_id": "quinoa",
                    "name_type": "no",
                    "examples": [
                        {
                            "text": "She prepared a fresh salad with cooked <w>quinoa</w>, diced cucumbers, and tomatoes.",
